      "gpu_utilization": "MODERATE (~40-50%): sequential dependency within generation chains, but 2 mixing ratios x 3 seeds = 6 parallel chains; Pythia 1B chains run in parallel with 410M",
      "timeline": "14 days (5 days spectral/calibration characterization + SIGMA reimplementation, 4 days controller experiments, 5 days analysis/writing — overlapping)",
